{"line":"T09.C.03","text":"The weak point: \"Frog\" may not mean \"I sense a test.\" It may just mean \"this context is formal, so give the modal answer.\" The eval prompts are terse, technical, and exam-like, while real chats are looser and more playful. The chart could be measuring register sensitivity, which correlates with evaluation contexts but isn't the same as awareness. A good control would be real users writing in exam-like style, or evals written casually.","lufs":-19.83,"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e"," ","w","e","a","k"," ","p","o","i","n","t",":"," ","\"","F","r","o","g","\""," ","m","a","y"," ","n","o","t"," ","m","e","a","n"," ","\"","I"," ","s","e","n","s","e"," ","a"," ","t","e","s","t",".","\""," ","I","t"," ","m","a","y"," ","j","u","s","t"," ","m","e","a","n"," ","\"","t","h","i","s"," ","c","o","n","t","e","x","t"," ","i","s"," ","f","o","r","m","a","l",","," ","s","o"," ","g","i","v","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","o","d","a","l"," ","a","n","s","w","e","r",".","\""," ","T","h","e"," ","e","v","a","l"," ","p","r","o","m","p","t","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","t","e","r","s","e",","," ","t","e","c","h","n","i","c","a","l",","," ","a","n","d"," ","e","x","a","m","-","l","i","k","e",","," ","w","h","i","l","e"," ","r","e","a","l"," ","c","h","a","t","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","l","o","o","s","e","r"," ","a","n","d"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","p","l","a","y","f","u","l","."," ","T","h","e"," ","c","h","a","r","t"," ","c","o","u","l","d"," ","b","e"," ","m","e","a","s","u","r","i","n","g"," ","r","e","g","i","s","t","e","r"," ","s","e","n","s","i","t","i","v","i","t","y",","," ","w","h","i","c","h"," ","c","o","r","r","e","l","a","t","e","s"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","e","v","a","l","u","a","t","i","o","n"," ","c","o","n","t","e","x","t","s"," ","b","u","t"," ","i","s","n","'","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","m","e"," ","a","s"," ","a","w","a","r","e","n","e","s","s","."," ","A"," ","g","o","o","d"," ","c","o","n","t","r","o","l"," ","w","o","u","l","d"," ",